# Frontend environment for a deployed (Vercel) build.
#
# In development the Vite dev server proxies /api to the local backend, so this
# is not needed. In production the frontend and backend are on different origins,
# so the full API base URL must be supplied.
#
# NOTE: the variable is VITE_API_URL (matching src/lib/api.ts) and it must
# include the /api/v1 path segment, because the axios client appends only the
# endpoint path to it.
#
# Replace with your real Render service URL, with no trailing slash:
VITE_API_URL=https://intellibank-api.onrender.com/api/v1
